# AI Actions Validation & Autofix

**CRITICAL:** After creating ALL app files, run `fdk validate` automatically and fix fatal errors.

## Mandatory Post-Creation Process

### Step 1: Run fdk validate
```bash
cd <app-directory>
fdk validate
```

### Step 2: Fix Fatal Errors Only (2 iterations)
**FIX:** JSON errors, missing files, manifest structure, request template errors, function name mismatch
**IGNORE:** Lint warnings, code style suggestions

### Step 3: Present Results
- If passes: "✅ AI Actions app generated and validated successfully!"
- If fails: List only FATAL errors with fix directions

## Validation Checklist

### manifest.json
- [ ] platform-version: "3.0"
- [ ] modules.common.requests declares all request templates
- [ ] modules.common.functions declares all action functions with timeout
- [ ] At least one product module (support_ticket, chat_conversation, etc.)
- [ ] engines block with node and fdk

### actions.json
- [ ] Function names match server.js exactly
- [ ] $schema in parameters and response
- [ ] All properties have descriptions
- [ ] required array for mandatory params

### config/requests.json
- [ ] Host is FQDN only (no path)
- [ ] Path starts with /
- [ ] Uses <%= %> not {{}}
- [ ] Single top-level JSON object

### server.js
- [ ] Uses $request.invokeTemplate() not .post/.get
- [ ] Uses renderData(null, data) for success
- [ ] Uses renderData(error, null) for errors
- [ ] Function names match actions.json

### test_data
- [ ] One JSON file per action: server/test_data/actionName.json
- [ ] Keys match parameter names
- [ ] Valid sample values
